OL,3,GNEWSARecognition for 105-year-old
OL,4,Aveteran Joan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 105-year-old veteran who served in
OL,7,Fthe Women's Auxiliary Air Force (WAAF)
OL,8,Fin World War Two has been honoured with
OL,9,Fa special presentation from a deputy
OL,10,Flieutenant of the West Midlands.
OL,12,FJoan Langley, from Sutton Coldfield,
OL,13,Fserved from 1940-1945, mainly on
OL,14,Fbarrage balloon defence, helping to
OL,15,Fprotect Birmingham, the Black Country,
OL,16,FCoventry, Worcestershire and
OL,17,FGloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
