OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSARecognition for 105-year-old
OL,4,Aveteran Joan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the presentation on
OL,7,FSaturday, during a sold-out Remembrance
OL,8,FDay concert at Sutton Coldfield Town
OL,9,FHall, Langley said the recognition had
OL,10,Fbeen wonderful and surprising.
OL,12,FIn May, she also had high tea with
OL,13,FBirmingham's Lord Mayor at The Council
OL,14,FHouse to celebrate her 105th birthday.
